\chapter*{Source and verification}
The authoritative APIs are in \api{MuDSL.hpp} and \api{MuDSL.d}.
MuLL packages are under \api{mull/stdlib}, native implementations under
\api{mull/native}, and the C bridge under \api{mull/bridge}. Run CMake and CTest as
described in Chapter 45. To rebuild this document, run \api{make -C book}.
The first 37 chapters are reproducibly exported from \api{manual/};
\api{book/export_manual.py --check} detects drift. The root \api{manual/}
and \api{MANIFEST.yaml} are typeset by \api{typeset-manuals.py} and
\api{typeset-manifest.py}; the build checks their generated fragments.
